    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_942 : answer(sorry) ↔ ∃ c > 0, ∃ (o : ℕ → ℝ), o =o[atTop] (1 : ℕ → ℝ) ∧\n    (∀ᶠ n in atTop, erdos_942.h n < (Real.log n) ^ (c + o n)) ∧\n    {n | erdos_942.h n > (Real.log n) ^ (c - o n)}.Infinite",
